**/*.log
# Agent runtime memory. The rest of `_bmad/` is vendored and committed, but this is
# state the skills accumulate across runs rather than anything this project authors --
# and these trees are already excluded from every linting and secret gate, so a growing
# unreviewed store inside a public repository is the wrong place for it. It persists on
# disk; it just is not published.
_bmad/memory/
# Poetry's project-local plugin environment, populated from [tool.poetry.requires-plugins].
.poetry/
# Poetry is the single dependency and lock source (ADR-0001); a uv lock is never committed.
uv.lock
